      "note": [
        "Time series break. As from reference year 2019, a new data source and method are used to produce the statistics. The monthly employer reports at individual level (AGI) have replaced the annual statements of earnings (KU) and gainfully employed persons are now classified based on wages/salaries paid in November. Further information on the changes is available at [www.scb.se/rams](http://www.scb.se/rams).",
        "The table was revised in March 2021 when 37,000 persons got the wrong industry. The revision affects employees in the municipalities and regions. "
